", "es": "Lucas Muñoz Muñoz (interiorista del año en los Iconic Awards 2025), Lázaro Rosa-Violán Studio (Prix Versailles Europa 2017) y Masquespacio, entre otros.", "tr": "Resmî bir sıralama yok. Bağımsız takdir gören stüdyolar arasında Ippolito Fleitz Group (Stuttgart), JOI-Design (Hamburg, oteller), Studio Aisslinger (Berlin) ve Landau + Kindelbacher (Münih) var."}}, {"q": {"en": "Is \"interior architect\" a protected title in Germany?", "de": "Ist „Innenarchitekt“ in Deutschland geschützt?", "es": "¿Cuál es el mejor estudio de interiorismo de Alemania?", "tr": "Almanya'da \"iç mimar\" unvanı korunuyor mu?"}, "a": {"en": "Yes. \"Innenarchitekt\" may only be used by people registered with a state chamber of architects (Architektenkammer).", "de": "Ja. Die Berufsbezeichnung darf nur führen, wer in die Liste einer Architektenkammer eingetragen ist.", "es": "No hay un ranking oficial. Con reconocimiento independiente destacan Ippolito Fleitz Group (Stuttgart), JOI-Design (Hamburgo, hoteles), Studio Aisslinger (Berlín) y Landau + Kindelbacher (Múnich).", "tr": "Evet. \"Innenarchitekt\" unvanını yalnızca bir eyalet mimarlar odasına kayıtlı kişiler kullanabilir."}}, {"q": {"en": "Which awards recognise the best interior design in Europe?", "de": "Welche Preise würdigen die beste Innenarchitektur in Europa?", "es": "¿Qué premios reconocen el mejor interiorismo de Europa?", "tr": "Avrupa'da en iyi iç mimarlığı hangi ödüller takdir ediyor?"}, "a": {"en": "The Dezeen Awards, FRAME Awards, Iconic Awards, German Design Award, Prix Versailles and the Restaurant & Bar Design Awards are among the most watched.", "de": "Zu den meistbeachteten gehören die Dezeen Awards, die FRAME Awards, die Iconic Awards, der German Design Award, der Prix Versailles und die Restaurant & Bar Design Awards.", "es": "Entre los más seguidos están los Dezeen Awards, los FRAME Awards, los Iconic Awards, el German Design Award, el Prix Versailles y los Restaurant & Bar Design Awards.", "tr": "En çok takip edilenler arasında Dezeen Awards, FRAME Awards, Iconic Awards, German Design Award, Prix Versailles ve Restaurant & Bar Design Awards var."}}]$v$::jsonb
